name lutabulartools
category Package
revision 63043
shortdesc lutabulartools provides some useful commands for tabular matter
longdesc lutabulartools provides some useful commands for tabular
longdesc matter. It uses LuaLaTeX and offers the ability to combine the
longdesc facilities of multirow, multicolumn, and makcell with an easy
longdesc to use syntax, and adds some enhanced rules for the booktabs
longdesc package.
